  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Being a Shandian has allowed you to make the most of your environment, maneuvering and escaping any unfavorable situation. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase your Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution score by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</li><li>Your movement speed is increased by 5ft, and your jump height is doubled.</li><li>You gain proficiency in either Acrobatics or Athletics. If you are already proficient, you gain expertise.</li><li>You have advantage on any Athletics or Acrobatics skill check to escape a grapple.</li></ul>",
